---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Projects
metaTitle: "Projects: Handmade Kitchens, Furniture & Joinery | Joel Dyter, Hebden Bridge"
description: "Kitchens, staircases, furniture and joinery handmade by Joel Dyter. Follow projects from hand drawing, through the workshop, to the finished room."
permalink: /projects/
---
<header class="page-hero page-hero--plain">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Projects</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">From the drawing board to your home</h1>
    <p class="lede">A selection of recent work. Where you see a stage count, the project page follows the piece from drawing, through the workshop, to the finished room.</p>
  </div>
</header>
<section class="section section--tight">
  <div class="container">
    {%- set cats = collections.projects | categories -%}
    <div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter projects" data-filters hidden>
      <button type="button" class="filter is-active" aria-pressed="true" data-filter="all">All</button>
      {%- for c in cats %}<button type="button" class="filter" aria-pressed="false" data-filter="{{ c }}">{{ c }}</button>{% endfor %}
    </div>
    <ul class="cards cards--list" data-filter-list>
      {%- asyncEach p in collections.projects %}<li data-category="{{ p.data.category }}">{% include "partials/project-card.njk" %}</li>{% endeach %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
